Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:28:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] linuxPackages.nvidiaPackages: fetch open kernel module
 sources from NVIDIA

Serve the open-gpu-kernel-modules source through fetchFromGithubOrNvidia
with the NVIDIA-hosted NVIDIA-kernel-module-source tarball as an
additional URL, stripping files that differ between the two archives so
one hash covers both, and stop curl from retrying 4xx responses so the
fallback URL is tried immediately. Enable the new fetchOpenFromNvidia
option for every driver shipping open module sources and update their
openSha256.

Assisted-by: omp: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
